{"metadata":{"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},5],"title":[{"Plain":"意象的形"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"∞-意象的形"},0],"subject":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"意象理论","text":"意象理论"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>意象的<strong>形</strong> (shape) 是一个 ("},{"Local":{"url":"pro-对象","text":"pro"}},{"Plain":") "},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":"; 对此有两种看法.</p>\n<ul>\n<li>我们知道"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":" $A$ 可视为"},{"Local":{"url":"∞-意象","text":"意象"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathsf{Ani}^A = \\mathsf{Ani}_{A/}$. 反过来, 对于一个"},{"Local":{"url":"∞-意象","text":"意象"}},{"Plain":", 我们想找一个与它 “尽可能接近” 的生象, 这就是它的<strong>形</strong>.</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"∞-意象","text":"意象"}},{"Plain":"的形是其"},{"Local":{"url":"终对象","text":"终对象"}},{"Plain":"的 “同伦型”.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>对于 $\\infty$-意象 $\\mathcal X$, 有唯一的"},{"Local":{"url":"几何态射","text":"几何态射"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n    \\pi=(\\pi^*\\dashv \\pi_*)\\colon \\mathcal X\\to\\mathsf{Ani}.\r\n$$\n由于"},{"Local":{"url":"常值层","text":"常值层"}},{"Plain":"函子 $\\pi^*\\colon \\mathsf{Ani}\\to\\mathcal X$ 保持有限极限, 其有"},{"Local":{"url":"形式伴随","text":"形式左伴随"}},{"Plain":" (落在 "},{"Local":{"url":"pro-生象","text":"pro-生象"}},{"Plain":"中)\n$$\r\n\\pi_!\\colon \\mathcal X \\to \\mathsf{Pro}\\mathsf{Ani} = \\mathsf{Fun}^{\\mathrm{lex}}(\\mathsf{Ani},\\mathsf{Ani})^{\\mathrm{op}}.\r\n$$\n定义 $\\mathcal X$ 的<strong>形</strong> (shape) $\\Pi \\mathcal X$ 为 "},{"Local":{"url":"pro-生象","text":"pro-生象"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\Pi\\mathcal X := \\pi_!(1).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>更具体地, 作为 $\\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathsf{Ani},\\mathsf{Ani})^{\\mathrm{op}}$ 的对象, $\\Pi \\mathcal X$ 是左正合函子\n$$\r\n    \\pi_*\\pi^*\\colon \\mathsf{Ani} \\to \\mathsf{Ani}.\r\n$$\n(注意 $\\pi_*$, $\\pi^*$ 均保持有限极限.)</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>. 若 $\\Pi\\mathcal X = \\pi_!(1)$ 是生象, 那么\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Ani}}(\\Pi\\mathcal X,A)\\simeq\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal X}(1,\\pi^* A)\\simeq\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Ani}}(1,\\pi_*\\pi^* A)\\simeq\\pi_*\\pi^* A.\r\n$$</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>. 对于"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":" $A$, 有 $\\Pi (\\mathsf{Ani}_{/A}) = A$.</p>\n<p>意象 $\\mathsf{Ani}_{/A}$ 正是生象 $A$ 在意象世界中的化身, 所以这个结论是意料之中的.</p>\n<p><strong>命题</strong>. 形函子 $\\Pi \\colon \\mathsf{Topos}\\to\\mathsf{ProAni}$ 是嵌入 $\\mathsf{Ani}_{/-} \\colon \\mathsf{Ani}\\to\\mathsf{Topos}$ 的形式左伴随:\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Topos}}(\\mathcal X,\\mathsf{Ani}_{/A})\\simeq\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal X}(1,\\pi^* A) \\simeq \\pi_*\\pi^* A.\r\n$$</p>\n<p>特别地, 当 $\\Pi\\mathcal X \\in\\mathsf{Ani}$ 时,\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Topos}}(\\mathcal X,\\mathsf{Ani}_{/A})\r\n\\simeq\r\n\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Ani}}(\\Pi\\mathcal X,A).\r\n$$</p>\n<p><em>证明</em>. 事实上下图为 $\\mathsf{Topos}$ 中的拉回,\n$$\r\n\\begin{array}\r\n    {ccc}\r\n    \\mathcal X_{/\\pi^* A} &amp; \\to &amp; \\mathsf{Ani}_{/A}\\\\\r\n    \\downarrow &amp; &amp; \\downarrow \\\\\r\n    \\mathcal X &amp; \\underset{\\pi}{\\to} &amp; \\mathsf{Ani}\r\n\\end{array}\r\n$$\n因而\n$$\r\n\\begin{aligned}\r\n    &amp;\\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Topos}}(\\mathcal X,\\mathsf{Ani}_{/A})\\\\\r\n    &amp;\\simeq\r\n    \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathsf{Topos}_{/\\mathcal X}}(\\mathcal X,\\mathcal X_{/\\pi^* A})\\\\\r\n    &amp;\\simeq \\operatorname{Hom}_{\\mathcal X}(1,\\pi^* A).\r\n\\end{aligned}\r\n$$</p>\n<h2>相关概念</h2>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"平展同伦论","text":"平展同伦论"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}